# Unicode CLDR 47, locale hi, gregorian abbreviated weekday names
# (cldr-json 47.0.0, cldr-dates-full/main/hi/ca-gregorian.json).
# Sense confirmed at en.wiktionary.org, entry “बुध”.
# The abbreviation is the bare planet name, which is an ordinary word in
# its own right (गुरु 'teacher', शुक्र 'Venus'), so it binds only the
# marker-ed weekday orders and never a bare weekday on its own.
बुध
